es the cut: He and Elvis's only child tied the knot in August 2002, then promptly filed for divorce the following November. Their divorce wasn ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.brides.com/gallery/shortest-marriages-celebrity-history\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d154\"},\"ref\":\"d154\",\"snippet\":\" ... According to Murphy, he was married to Davidson, and this came to light after Davidson passed away in a car accident in 1996.\\n\\nMurphy's other eight children were born to women who were not in a serious relationship with the NBA star. In 2004, five of Murphy ... \",\"title\":\"https://fadeawayworld.net/20-nba-stars-with-the-most-children-calvin-murphy-has-14-kids\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d155\"},\"ref\":\"d155\",\"snippet\":\" ... The Murphys are the Garveys' neighbors in Jarden.\\n*Kevin Carroll as John Murphy (seasons 2–3), Erika's husband and head of Jarden's volunteer fire department. He subsequently marries Laurie, and operates as a fraudulent medium.\\n*Jovan Adepo as Michael Murphy (seasons 2–3), Erika and John ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Leftovers_(TV_series)\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d156\"},\"ref\":\"d156\",\"snippet\":\" ... 9, Silva's son from a previous relationship.\\n\\nGere, 73, is also dad to son Homer, born in 2000 when Gere was married to second wife Carey Lowell.\\n\\nClint Eastwood\\n\\nDad to seven children at the age of 63 (the eldest of which was born in 1954), Eastwood ... \",\"title\":\"https://people.com/the-oldest-hollywood-dads-6116784\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d157\"},\"ref\":\"d157\",\"snippet\":\" ... 7 Tracey Edmonds & Eddie Murphy – 14 Days\\n\\nCelebrities are known to make hobbies of relationships and marriages, and every so often, the biggest stars are part of the dialogue. Eddie Murphy has five baby mamas in the entertainment industry, and when he married Tracey Edmonds, many wondered how ... \",\"title\":\"https://listverse.com/2022/07/15/10-shortest-marriages-in-history/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[{\"end\":3000,\"ref\":\"e1\",\"start\":0},{\"end\":9000,\"ref\":\"e2\",\"start\":3000}],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d15\"},\"ref\":\"d15\",\"snippet\":\" ... In the case of Jessica and Richard Harmon, though, the siblings actually play unrelated characters in the world of The 100.\\n\\nJessica plays Niylah, a character who shows up in the third season and has been with Clarke on a couple of different occasions. Richard played John Murphy ... \",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/cw-stars-family/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d158\"},\"ref\":\"d158\",\"snippet\":\" ... For the Oct. 14 ceremony at the Ritz-Carlton Maui, Kapalua, Murphy wore a Monique Lhuillier gown and little Nora served as the flower girl.\\n\\n\\\"We really are so committed to one another, where we already feel married, Murphy said. \\\"But to have our day, and to finally ... \",\"title\":\"https://people.com/celebrity/celebrity-weddings-of-2022/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d159\"},\"ref\":\"d159\",\"snippet\":\" ... Murphy was born to John E. Murphy Jr., DO, '52, and Charlotte A. Murphy in Dayton, Ohio, on July 18, 1951. Dr. Murphy is survived by Charlotte S. Murphy; their children, son Shawn Murphy and daughter-in-law Marcella Kim, daughter Shannon Cooper and son-in-law Steve ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.atsu.edu/news/in-memoriam-16\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"0c2bddc99e3cf2b9f293d677c425047ac33707324c58a0c688c9c736b98f1419\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"13ef93a615031dc49e5c915634dfb31dafdd700b5a9c98a0d459e71a995294a3\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"John Murphy The 100 married relationships\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d125\"},\"ref\":\"d125\",\"snippet\":\" ... Chalke is still chiefly a live-action comedic actress today but has done some more voice work in the past, including on Clone High and American Dad.\\n\\nKari Wahlgren\\n\\nJessica, Cynthia, Samantha, Mother Gaia\\n\\nKari Wahlgren works extensively as a voice actress for animated movies, TV shows, and ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.denofgeek.com/tv/rick-and-morty-voice-actors-guide/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d139\"},\"ref\":\"d139\",\"snippet\":\" ... Megan Fox\\n\\nWhat actress is 5 feet 4 inches? Megan Fox is one of the actresses with these height measurements. She is an American actress who made her acting debut in the family film Holiday in the Sun.\\n\\nMegan Fox is known for her vampy and stylish looks ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.tuko.co.ke/facts-lifehacks/celebrity-biographies/512328-famous-celebrities-54-inspire-dressing/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d138\"},\"re